# Cambridge source documents (syllabus PDFs, and anything ever obtained from
# the School Support Hub) are fetched on demand by
# scripts/fetch_cambridge_sources.py and are NEVER committed.
#
# This is stricter than the CAPS/IEB rule and deliberately so: Cambridge
# refuses permission for electronic reproduction of past-paper questions,
# mark schemes and examiner reports in any format, and its syllabus copying
# permission runs to registered centres for internal use only - neither
# covers redistribution via this repository. sources_manifest.json (URL +
# sha256 provenance) IS committed; it records what was read without
# republishing it.
*.pdf
source/
